{"3651540":{"success":true,"data":{"type":"game","name":"Peeping Office Worker","steam_appid":3651540,"required_age":0,"is_free":false,"detailed_description":"<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Story<\/h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You've just started your career at the renowned but enigmatic Omnituens Corp, only to discover you've been assigned to a clandestine role with responsibilities shrouded in mystery.<\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >As you delve deeper into the company's operations, you'll begin to uncover and control its most valuable secrets.<\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/3651540\/extras\/9afe8afded0c39d919c3c33d83aba818.avif?t=1792430273\" data-big-src=https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/3651540\/extras_big\/9afe8afded0c39d919c3c33d83aba818.avif?t=1792430273 width=1560 height=878 \/><\/span><\/p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Gameplay<\/strong><\/h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Uncover Clues:<\/strong> Engage in conversations and meticulously search through text to find hidden &quot;keywords&quot; that unlock new information.<\/p><\/li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Analyze and Unravel:<\/strong> Piece together the keywords you've collected to expose the deeper secrets lurking within the company and its employees.<\/p><\/li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Climb the Corporate Ladder:<\/strong> Complete missions to boost your job performance, earning promotions that grant you greater authority and access.<\/p><\/li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Forge Intimate Relationships:<\/strong> Use the information and influence you've gained to your advantage. Pursue the beautiful women in your office, uncovering their personal secrets and developing unique, intimate relationships with them.<\/p><\/li><\/ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Characters<\/strong><br><br><s